{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/2d7da9396ff1f7672110580f23a9e8fa.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange facility with no recollection of who you are or how you got there. That is, until a voice calling themselves \u2018Ada\u2019 on the other end of an intercom warns you that you\u2019re being hunted, and promises to help you escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bittersweet Birthday is a story-driven action-adventure game where every fight is personal, every victory hard-earned, and every clue a step towards uncovering the truth lying somewhere inside the miasma of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter is a one-on-one showdown with one of your nemeses. Read your enemy, master their rhythm, and adapt to their patterns that blend Souls-like precision with bullet-hell chaos. Punch, kick, block, dodge and parry your way through multiple phases that feel like a final boss each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/24150e91ac046cde0d78f5b356c56029.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/24150e91ac046cde0d78f5b356c56029.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/24150e91ac046cde0d78f5b356c56029.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak the challenge to your liking through the Memory system. Memories are gameplay modifiers directly tied to the character\u2019s pasts. They can make fights easier or harder, but never trivial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/05677c5bda7741b7f96b11e3a124030f.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/05677c5bda7741b7f96b11e3a124030f.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/05677c5bda7741b7f96b11e3a124030f.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.apng?t=1763439283\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=112 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights, catch your breath in a vibrant village full of strange and endearing characters. Complete side quests, dig into local mysteries, and enjoy a surprising amount of heartfelt (and often ridiculous) downtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at darts! Or well\u2026 I guess darts are partially used, at least.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rock, paper, scissors \u2013 fighting game edition!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down all 48 Gachapon collectibles, each one of the cool, cute, or creepy kind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art and detailed backgrounds bring every memory and location to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable controls with support for PlayStation, Xbox, and PC controllers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY THAT LIVES UP TO ITS NAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bittersweet Birthday mixes psychological horror, sci-fi mystery, and dry humor into a story about identity, trauma, and what it means to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths are hard to remember\u2026 others, hard to forget.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/a385acef8506af61e7e59b2a3a8dc339.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/a385acef8506af61e7e59b2a3a8dc339.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/a385acef8506af61e7e59b2a3a8dc339.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Do you recall everything now?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/6650a9841d0467cf820251c9a8c78bb264a2bc2e.jpg"},{"name":"A fine collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/38069eb4e8e6415f4cea0d6f3ddadb8e22f45d76.jpg"},{"name":"Bull\u2019s eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/5032a5c11357f4b063778ada653f118efbe1700c.jpg"},{"name":"Unfazed by the pressure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/35d0c10232679aede13de091a5d6a28b58e1ddca.jpg"},{"name":"Newbies got hands!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/57df19e2b49a902674a81c3b99a7eaa1ae4abe52.jpg"},{"name":"A matter of facing it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/7e10234d6f7f13dcc4376dccf3752eb98b1fc948.jpg"},{"name":"A matter of knowing when to face away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/988bfaad474d3045b58a88ed2ab9f20bdbe1939e.jpg"},{"name":"A matter of holding on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/4d82c5c944409549b60800969ddf9ea3981ccbf3.jpg"},{"name":"A morning almost like any other.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/2691e77ee1a75fc7c4258b684e69d71fb7254d42.jpg"},{"name":"A night almost like any other.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581100/f3c577a8a253bdef32458c168aa71884b83c090c.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1581100?t=1763439283","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/965a270c74902bd1bcfea62ab31bbd2cfeadf737/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763439283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/0b8ef7da868f99c511259f7f9b21d950d4df0f82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763439283","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/0b8ef7da868f99c511259f7f9b21d950d4df0f82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763439283","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-al