lous) downtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/6c76696e2e6b68b7998bbc0842355f48.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at darts! Or well\u2026 I guess darts are partially used, at least.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rock, paper, scissors \u2013 fighting game edition!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down all 48 Gachapon collectibles, each one of the cool, cute, or creepy kind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.poster.avif?t=1763439283\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.webm?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/ae64788be02017295af4f3207b8559b7.mp4?t=1763439283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art and detailed backgrounds bring every memory and location to li