rage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1799,"final_formatted":"$17.99 USD","initial":1799,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["DANGEN Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"true"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Selbstmord\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"11 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cBittersweet Birthday is a diamond in the rough. Evoking both a coming-of-age story and the tribulations of childhood trauma, Bittersweet Birthday deserves to be seen and appreciated for the beautiful, challenging journey it is.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Screen Hype<br><br>\u201cBittersweet Birthday is a reminder of why indie video games remain the most creative soul of the medium. With brilliant art direction, a demanding combat system and a story full of symbolism and emotion, World Eater Games has made an outstanding debut.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Generacion Gamer<br><br>\u201cBittersweet Birthday is a bold and cohesive package that will strongly appeal to players who appreciate a rigorous challenge wrapped in a captivating narrative. Its unique boss-rush structure ensures consistently high-quality combat, while its thoughtful exploration and quirky characters provide a rich emotional counterpoint. The game is not for the faint of heart, as its difficulty can be punishing, but for those willing to embrace its chaotic combat and unravel its dark secrets, the reward is an unforgettable journey through a world that is both terrifying and tender. It's a testament to how tonal shifts and focused game design can create a truly distinctive experience in the indie scene.\u201d<br>4.2/5 \u2013 OMEGASCOPIO<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared